---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page
  title="Pricing | UnsaidSignals"
  description="Pricing for UnsaidSignals will be announced soon. Join early access to shape the roadmap."
  canonical="/pricing"
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 text-center sm:px-6 lg:py-20">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-100">Pricing</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-zinc-300">Plans are currently in progress while we onboard early teams.</p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-zinc-400">Join early access to help shape packaging and receive launch updates.</p>
    <a
      href="https://app.unsaidsignals.com"
      class="mt-8 inline-flex rounded-md bg-brand-500 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-brand-400"
    >
      Get Early Access
    </a>
  </section>
</Page>
